@startuml
title GoF Pattern : Observer+Mediator

note as GoFLabel
  **<<Observer+Mediator>>**
end note

class "User" {
  + id: int
  + name: String
  + update(): void
}
class "Subscriber" {
  + name: String
  + attach(): void
  + detach(): void
}
class "Mediator" {
  + notify(): void
}
class "ConcreteMediator" {
  + notify(): void
}
class "ConcreteSubscriber" {
  + name: String
  + update(): void
}

User --> Mediator : notify
Subscriber --> Mediator : notify
Mediator --> ConcreteSubscriber : notify
ConcreteSubscriber --> ConcreteMediator : notify
GoFLabel .. User
@enduml